      "role": "user",
      "content": "Interesting. You put Chloe and Julian at the top, mostly because of their background and communication style. Can you dig a bit deeper into why you placed Marcus and Aarav so much lower? I'm trying to understand if there's a specific \"look\" or personality type you're seeing as more \"boardroom ready\" compared to them. Is it a matter of how they come across vs. just their technical skills?",
